# ClaudeExtra.list — user-maintained Claude extra routing matches
# GitHub repo: 626340700/clash_rule
# Classical / text provider: do not append a policy/group name to these lines.
# All entries are routed to the target group via RULE-SET,ClaudeExtra,✴️ claude.
# This file is updated when YOU commit; it does not self-discover new services.

# Cloudflare / Persona / hCaptcha / OAuth verification
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,challenges.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,withpersona.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hcaptcha.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hcaptcha.net
DOMAIN,anthropic.auth0.com
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com

# Statsig feature flags, experiments and SDK endpoints
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsigapi.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsigcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,featuregates.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,beyondwickedmapping.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,featureassets.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,assetsconfigcdn.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,prodregistryv2.org
# Statsig official SDK list includes this host too; may also carry unrelated encrypted DNS traffic.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare-dns.com

# Diagnostics and monitoring
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,segment.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,segment.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,growthbook.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,usefathom.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomassets.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflareinsights.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,siftscience.com
DOMAIN,anthropic-com.ghost.io

# Anthropic帮助中心确认的Yoti年龄验证，个人在线规则尚未收录
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,yoti.com  

# Broad guardrail: unknown Claude / Anthropic labeled domains
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,claude
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,anthropic
